				},
				{
					"id": 721611310,
					"content": "在奉行大人面前搖尾乞憐，討得點殘渣剩飯，又在稻妻武士面前趾高氣揚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611311,
					"content": "打探來打探去、到處攪混水不說…現在還專程跑來這條破船上，也不知有何貴幹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611312,
					"content": "#可惜呀，我不過一介傷兵，沒什麼能招待{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611313,
					"content": "所以還要煩請大人自己用腿走出去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611314,
					"content": "這傢伙完全不會好好說話嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611315,
					"content": "#好了，{F#妳}{M#你}們太吵了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611316,
					"content": "#臨走前給{F#妳}{M#你}們一句忠告吧：別在八醞島待太久，這座島已經被詛咒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611317,
					"content": "詛咒…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721611318,
					"content": "聽不懂嗎？這座島被詛咒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611319,
					"content": "停滯的戰爭、大人們的欲望、小人物的絕望、無辜受難者的憎恨，老人臨終時彌漫滿屋的藥劑氣味…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611320,
					"content": "總而言之，就是詛咒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611321,
					"content": "#趁{F#妳}{M#你}還沒被壓垮，趕緊離開吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻葉久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611322,
					"content": "唔…完全聽不懂，真是個怪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7216114,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
